    {
        "content": "<p>Discussion thread for <a class=\"stream-topic\" data-stream-id=\"113486\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/113486-announce/topic/Axiom.20Lean.20Engine/with/577609358\">#announce &gt; Axiom Lean Engine</a></p>",
